flowchart TD
    A[Start New Project] --> B{Team size?}
    B -->|"2-15 devs"| C[Modular Monolith with Spring Modulith]
    B -->|"50+ devs, multiple teams"| D[Consider Microservices]

    C --> E[Define Module Boundaries]
